'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Story chapters|story chapter]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''.

==Description==
{{quote|Mechanic and I got to talking about that plane that went down somewhere in the nature reserve. Nobody really knows what happened to it. I should track it down and take a look — maybe I'll find something interesting.}}

==Requirements==
Ask [[Mechanic]] about the downed plane while progressing through the story chapter [[Tour]].

==Objectives==
* Locate the fallen plane
* Reach Loyalty Level 2 with [[Prapor]]
* Ask the traders about the fallen plane
* (''Optional'') Hand over 2,000 [[Dollars|USD]] to [[Therapist]] to learn details about the right G-Wagon SUV
* Retrieve the [[G-Wagon flash drive|flash drive]] from one of the G-Wagon SUVs
* Hand over the [[G-Wagon flash drive|flash drive]] to [[Prapor]]
* Wait for information from [[Prapor]]
* Retrieve the [[Crashed plane's flight recorder|plane's flight recorder]]
* Leave the [[Crashed plane's flight recorder|flight recorder]] in the specified spot
* Visit [[Prapor]]
* Hand over 3 found [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] [[Rechargeable battery|Rechargeable batteries]]
* Hand over 5 found [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] [[Printed circuit board]]s
* Hand over 2 found [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] [[Toolset]]s
* Wait for information from [[Prapor]]
* Hand over the [[Plane crew transcript|flight crew's transcript]] to [[Prapor]]
* Hand over [[Elektronik's flash drive|Elektronik's secure flash drive]] to [[Prapor]]
* Wait for information from [[Prapor]]
* Retrieve the [[Armored case|armored case]]
** (''Optional'') Find any [[Note from Mr. Kerman|additional clues]]
* Keep the [[Armored case|armored case]] for yourself '''or''' hand it over to [[Prapor]]

==Guide==
===Locate the fallen plane===
The fallen plane is located on the eastern side of [[Woods]].
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:Falling Skies Map.jpg|Location marked on map
File:Woods Showcase 12.png|The wanted plane
</gallery></li>

===Speak to [[Prapor]]===
Visit [[Prapor]] in the menu through the trader screen and ask him about the fallen plane.

===Reach Loyalty Level 2 with [[Prapor]]===
To get further information about the plane, you have to reach loyalty level 2 with [[Prapor]] and then ask him again about the fallen plane.

===Ask the traders about the fallen plane===
Visit [[Prapor]], [[Therapist]], [[Skier]], [[Mechanic]] and [[Jaeger]] in the menu through the trader screen and ask them about the fallen plane.

