====Rewards====
You will receive the reward once you hand over both items.
* 300,000 Roubles
** 315,000 Roubles with [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center]] Level 1
** 345,000 Roubles with [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center]] Level 2

===Wait for the information from Prapor===
Wait 1-3 hours then visit [[Prapor]] in the menu through the trader screen and ask him about the fallen plane. [[Prapor]] asks if you read the transcript and if you answer with yes, you'll get a reward, if you answer with no you won't.

====Rewards====
* 300,000 Roubles
** 315,000 Roubles with [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center]] Level 1
** 345,000 Roubles with [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center]] Level 2

