===Keep the armored case for yourself or hand it over to [[Prapor]]===
'''<font color="red">This is an important point of no return choice! It influences the course of the story chapter [[The Ticket]].</font>'''
[[File:The Ticket Flowchart by Callsign Smokey.png|thumb|right|240px|Decision consequences flowchart|link={{filepath:The Ticket Flowchart by Callsign Smokey.png}}]]

====Decision: Keep the armored case====
=====Rewards=====
* +80,000 [[EXP]]
* [[Prapor]] Rep <font color="red">'''-0.7'''</font>
* 1× [[Armored case]]
* Unlocks achievement [[Achievements#Achievements|Just Business]]

====Decision: Hand over the armored case directly to [[Prapor]]====
=====Rewards=====
* +80,000 [[EXP]]
* 1,000,000 Roubles
** 1,050,000 Roubles with [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center]] Level 1
** 1,150,000 Roubles with [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center]] Level 2
* Unlocks achievement [[Achievements#Achievements|Man of His Word]]

====Decision: Pretend you didn't find the armored case, but still hand it over to [[Prapor]]====
=====Rewards=====
* +80,000 [[EXP]]
* 1,000,000 Roubles
** 1,050,000 Roubles with [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center]] Level 1
** 1,150,000 Roubles with [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center]] Level 2
* Unlocks achievement [[Achievements#Achievements|Man of His Word]]

